History id: 1.001
Comment:
This version of the code is identical to ExpertPlay-Rev6.102

Affected modules:

==========================================
Modification time stamp: 25.04.20-18:18:52
History id: 1.002
Comment:
All code to handle QUIRK trees has been deleted. A number of routines
have been renamed to reflect new naming conventions and a number of
routines have been deleted as they are no longer used.
The buiild of the SCARD sequences has been recoded. We now use only
SCARD sequences restricted to the current hoilding of each player.
The bump_*routines are replaced by cpp define's.
add_node has been rewritten.
A new '-s' option allows sorting of the plays before convert_tree_to_quirk
is called.

