Modification time stamp: 01.05.20-10:08:52
History id: 1.004
Comment:
Merging of North-south branches is standard enabled. North-south branches
are merge only if both plays have no effect on who wins in the current trick;
Some reordering of the code in fold_ew_tree;
The leaves are no longer merged explicitly in merge tree.
Some cleanupleanup.

